%description:

Tcp.pmtudEnabled:on-ipv6 -- over IPv6, a Packet Too Big of the route reduces the MSS.

The claim (Tcp.ned): "Path MTU Discovery (RFC 1191, RFC 1981) enabled/disabled"; RFC
1981 is the PMTUD of IPv6, where a router sends a Packet Too Big and never fragments.

The class on-ipv6: Tcp::processIcmpv6Error() finds the connection, and
TcpConnection::processIcmpv6Error() reduces the MSS to the MTU of the Packet Too Big. This facet comes from the coverage gap loop: no test reached the code of this part. This
test separates "on" from "off", where the segments that are too large never pass the router.

Host under test: host1, on IPv6 nodes (precondition); the network is TapRouterNetwork, and the
interface of the router to host2 has an MTU of 1280 bytes. The application of host1 opens at
3 s, after the address configuration, and sends 10000 bytes at 3.1 s. Observation: level 1, a
data frame reaches host2, and its IPv6 payload is at most 1240 bytes.

%# parameter: Tcp.pmtudEnabled
%# class: on-ipv6
%# value: true
%# key: *.host1.tcp.pmtudEnabled
%# expected-result: PASS

%includes:
#include "ProtocolTest.h"

%global:

using namespace inet;
using namespace inet::protocoltest;

Define_ProtocolTestProgram()
{
    return ProtocolTest("TcpPmtudEnabledOnIpv6")
        .once(on("host2.eth[0].mac").signal("packetReceivedFromLower")
             .filterPacket("ipv6.payloadLength > 100B")
             .first()
                  .assertPacket("ipv6.payloadLength <= 1240B")
             .describe("the first data frame at host2")
             .within(4.5));
}

%activity:
EV << "TcpPmtudEnabledOnIpv6 compiled\n";

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
*.host1.tcp.pmtudEnabled = true    # the parameter under test
*.host*.typename = "StandardHost6"
*.configurator.typename = "Ipv6NetworkConfigurator"
**.ipv6.configurator.networkConfiguratorModule = "configurator"
*.router.typename = "Router6"
network = inet.protocoltest.TapRouterNetwork
*.router.eth[1].mac.mtu = 1280B
*.host1.app[0].tOpen = 3s
*.host1.app[0].tSend = 3.1s
include ../../parameter/ini/_bulk.ini
include ../../parameter/ini/_base.ini

%contains: stdout
PROTOCOLTEST TcpPmtudEnabledOnIpv6: PASS
